{"id":"8595a46bd83435a9","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-godel-sentence-modal.md","title":"Gödel Fixed-Point Class with an Explicit Letter Parameter","display":"df-godel-sentence-modal — Gödel Fixed-Point Class with an Explicit Letter Parameter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-godel-sentence-modal","aliases":["89-df-godel-sentence-modal"],"display":"df-godel-sentence-modal — Gödel Fixed-Point Class with an Explicit Letter Parameter","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-godel-sentence-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-godel-sentence-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-sentence-modal — Gödel Fixed-Point Class with an Explicit Letter Parameter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02536e2efd437c59\" href=\"?note=02536e2efd437c59\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-modal\">89-df-fixed-point-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为模态化公式的弱不动点集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}\">\\(\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}\\)</span> 为下文定义的带字母参数的类；在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的上下文中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal G_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是其旧记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\neg\\Box p,p),\n\\qquad\\mathcal G_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\neg\\Box p,p),\n\\qquad\\mathcal G_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 104–105；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 指本书的 GL 模态语言，真正可变的字母参数是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>。旧记号仅在已固定同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 时使用，不把不同的排除字母条件混成一个无参数类。成员 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box G)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\">\\((G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box G)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box p\">\\(\\neg\\Box p\\)</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 模态化，弱条件与原书加强不动点条件等价；本类允许其他字母，不额外声称所有成员在语法上无字母。\n在算术实现下，所得等价是句子与其不可证断言之间的 PA 可证等价。它不是元层不可证性，也不是公式语法相等。存在性与代表元见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9d2a6862fd2083e6\" href=\"?note=9d2a6862fd2083e6\" title=\"89-ex-godel-sentence-modal\">89-ex-godel-sentence-modal</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","status":"resolved","id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-ex-godel-sentence-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9d2a6862fd2083e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"下标 $\\Box$ 指本书的 GL 模态语言，真正可变的字母参数是 $p$。旧记号仅在已固定同一个 $p$ 时使用，不把不同的排除字母条件混成一个无参数类。成员 $G$ 不含 $p$，且 $(G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box G)\\in\\mathrm{GL}$。由于 $\\neg\\Box p$ 关于 $p$ 模态化，弱条件与原书加强不动点条件等价；本类允许其他字母，不额外声称所有成员在语法上无字母。\n在算术实现下，所得等价是句子与其不可证断言之间的 PA 可证等价。它不是元层不可证性，也不是公式语法相等。存在性与代表元见 [[89-ex-godel-sentence-modal]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\neg\\Box p,p),\n\\qquad\\mathcal G_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"(G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box G)\\in\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":1622,"backlinks":[{"id":"9d2a6862fd2083e6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-sentence-modal]]、[[89-df-henkin-sentence-modal]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-sentence-modal]]"}],"outgoing":["02536e2efd437c59","9d2a6862fd2083e6"]}